B.bX0=new A.h4("Verification documents","Artisan ID files are limited to PDF or image files up to 1 MB and are stored in secure document storage.")
B.bX8=new A.h4("Incident response","Report suspicious behavior or security concerns through Support or the chat report menu so the team can review accounts and platform activity.")
